   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pool Technique Donor harmonisation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Pool Technique Givarkoordinering</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Pool technique, givarharmoniseringssekretariat i Mali,      under 2011, med m&#xf6;jlighet till avtalsf&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngning beroende p&#xe5; om       projektet f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngs.Pool Technique finansieras genom en gemensam korg  som sk&#xf6;ts av UNDP i Mali. PT har en viktig roll i genomf&#xf6;randet av    Parisdeklarationen och Accras handlingsplan f&#xf6;r bist&#xe5;ndseffektivitet  i Mali.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Pool technique, donor harmonisation secretariat in Mali,   foreseen for 2011, with a possible extension should the project be    prolonged. Pool Technique is financed through a joint basket fund     under the auspices of UNDP in Mali. It plays a significant role in    the Paris and Accra agenda work in Mali.</narrative>
  </description>
